  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker is aware of the Urgent 11 / VxWorks vulnerability and is closely monitoring and assessing the situation. Our product and global security operations teams are taking precautions to secure our infrastructure and products from these new vulnerabilities. To date, we have not received any reports of this vulnerability impacting our devices.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A thorough evaluation of all potentially impacted products has been conducted. Certain Stryker products utilize versions of VxWorks that are not affected by these vulnerabilities. We are not aware of any impact to our products or systems.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Further information can be found here:</span>&nbsp;<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.us-cert.gov/ics/advisories/icsa-19-211-01\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">https://www.us-cert.gov/ics/advisories/icsa-19-211-01</span></a></p>\n<p>If further analysis identifies impacted product, we will communicate through our normal customer communications methods directly from the applicable Stryker Division.</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 19 2019 18:14:24 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
